What is her name?

694
01:16:25.666 --> 01:16:27.031
Who is her mother?

695
01:16:36.093 --> 01:16:37.253
I have food.

696
01:16:43.642 --> 01:16:44.642
I have these.

697
01:16:46.395 --> 01:16:49.478
But you can have them.
Here. take them all.

698
01:16:49.565 --> 01:16:51.601
For you and the child. Here.

699
01:17:02.744 --> 01:17:03.950
Milk"?

700
01:17:24.433 --> 01:17:25.548
Merci.

701
01:17:33.942 --> 01:17:35.182
Bonjour.

702
01:17:37.279 --> 01:17:39.144
Bonyjour.

703
01:17:42.784 --> 01:17:44.775
Children? You?

704
01:17:44.870 --> 01:17:47.282
Shh.

705
01:17:48.207 --> 01:17:49.367
It's all right.

706
01:17:56.548 --> 01:17:58.254
Continuez.

707
