"They went to sea in a sieve. they did...

708
01:18:07.684 --> 01:18:09.800
In a sieve they went to sea:

709
01:18:11.230 --> 01:18:13.687
In spite of all their friends could say...

710
01:18:14.733 --> 01:18:17.395
On a winter's morn. on a stormy day.

711
01:18:18.362 --> 01:18:20.444
in a sieve they went to sea!

712
01:18:21.698 --> 01:18:24.735
Far and few. far and few.

713
01:18:24.826 --> 01:18:27.158
are the lands where the jumblies live;

714
01:18:28.789 --> 01:18:32.373
their heads are green.
and their hands are blue...

715
01:18:34.962 --> 01:18:37.203
And they went to sea in a sieve."

716
