763
01:33:01.869 --> 01:33:04.986
- We're the second wave.
- They don't send us all at once.

764
01:33:05.081 --> 01:33:06.617
Yeah. we're d company.

765
01:33:06.707 --> 01:33:09.289
We spent the night diggin' in.
We go last.

766
01:33:11.587 --> 01:33:13.123
Are you all right?

767
