MacKenzie.

768
01:33:14.507 --> 01:33:15.713
Where's colonel MacKenzie?

769
01:33:15.800 --> 01:33:17.210
Well. he's down at the line.

770
01:33:17.927 --> 01:33:19.087
- Which way?
- This way.

771
01:33:19.178 --> 01:33:20.509
We're headed up there now.

772
01:33:21.305 --> 01:33:23.296
Steady on. mate.
Where you going?

773
01:33:44.704 --> 01:33:45.704
Movel

774
01:33:50.001 --> 01:33:51.081
let me by!

775
01:33:55.590 --> 01:33:56.750
Let me through!

776
01:33:56.841 --> 01:34:00.129
Remember. follow your platoon commander.

777
01:34:00.845 --> 01:34:03.837
Stay spread out
and watch for his orders.

778
01:34:03.931 --> 01:34:06.923
- Where is your commanding officer?
- He's in the holding pen.

779
01:34:07.018 --> 01:34:10.886
Raise your signal flags
or fire the signal flares

780
01:34:10.980 --> 01:34:13.517
